@verbatim

<div class="hero"><div><h1>Organization priorities</h1><p>A shared workplace priority list, not a personal assignment list. Generated from the workplace profile, legal status, risk controls, due dates and SOLVE/OSHWA gaps.</p></div><button class="btn teal" onclick="generateNextSteps()" type="button">Recalculate priorities</button></div>
<div class="next-grid">
<div class="card next-board"><h4>Priority queue</h4><p class="note">Every priority below is interactive. Use the open button to jump straight to the right module.</p><div class="list" id="nextList"></div></div>
<div class="card next-guide"><h4>First 90 days / new OSH coordinator</h4>
<div class="list">
<div class="roadmap-item"><div class="meta"><strong>Week 1 / Know the workplace</strong><small>Complete profile, legal applicability, OSH policy, roles and urgent housekeeping, fire and first-aid checks.</small></div><div class="roadmap-actions"><span class="badge green">Start</span><button class="btn small" onclick="go('workplace')" type="button">Open setup</button></div></div>
<div class="roadmap-item"><div class="meta"><strong>Weeks 2–4 / Know the work</strong><small>Collect JMS, build HIRARC by job step, create the first action plan and set up the committee if applicable.</small></div><div class="roadmap-actions"><span class="badge blue">Comply</span><button class="btn small" onclick="go('hirarc')" type="button">Open HIRARC</button></div></div>
<div class="roadmap-item"><div class="meta"><strong>Month 2 / Close obvious gaps</strong><small>PPE, PTW, training, chemicals, emergency plan, incidents and inspections.</small></div><div class="roadmap-actions"><span class="badge amber">Comply</span><button class="btn small" onclick="go('capa')" type="button">Open actions</button></div></div>
<div class="roadmap-item"><div class="meta"><strong>Month 3 / Assess maturity</strong><small>Run OSHWA self-assessment, review HRA needs and build the next 90-day improvement plan.</small></div><div class="roadmap-actions"><span class="badge purple">Manage</span><button class="btn small" onclick="go('solve')" type="button">Open maturity</button></div></div>
<div class="roadmap-item"><div class="meta"><strong>Stay on track with dates</strong><small>Use the compliance planner to update due dates and coordinate linked reminders across the prototype.</small></div><div class="roadmap-actions"><span class="badge teal">Linked</span><button class="btn small" onclick="go('calendar')" type="button">Open calendar</button></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

@endverbatim
